  <div class="column-2 container responsivegrid cmp-container--padding-top-large cmp-container--padding-left-xlarge cmp-container--padding-top-small-mobile cmp-container--padding-left-medium-mobile cmp-container--padding-right-medium-mobile">

    
    
    
    <div id="container-9d43d18be6" class="cmp-container">
        
        
        <div class="title title__gradient-skyBlueWhite title__fontWeight-light title__white title__paddingBottom-large">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;title-67bad06fe5&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;core/wcm/components/title/v3/title&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-03-03T23:16:30Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Cloud-Native Origins&#34;}}" id="title-67bad06fe5" class="cmp-title">
    <h2 class="cmp-title__text">Cloud-Native Origins</h2>
</div>

    

</div>
<div class="text text__white text__paddingBottom-large">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-217ad7c7a7&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;druvaincprogram/components/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-03-03T23:22:16Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p style=\&#34;margin: 0.0px;\&#34;>Druva was built for a world where data no longer lives in one place. So we built cloud-native from day one, while much of the industry stayed tied to infrastructure.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p style=\&#34;margin: 0.0px;\&#34;>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p style=\&#34;margin: 0.0px;\&#34;>Born in the cloud means global scale, stronger security, faster innovation, and a better operating model for IT and security teams. It also positions Druva to lead what’s next: an AI-powered world where resilience has to move as fast as the business.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-217ad7c7a7" class="cmp-text">
    <p style="	margin: 0.0px;
">Druva was built for a world where data no longer lives in one place. So we built cloud-native from day one, while much of the industry stayed tied to infrastructure.</p>
<p style="	margin: 0.0px;
"> </p>
<p style="	margin: 0.0px;
">Born in the cloud means global scale, stronger security, faster innovation, and a better operating model for IT and security teams. It also positions Druva to lead what’s next: an AI-powered world where resilience has to move as fast as the business.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

        
    </div>

</div>

</div>
</div>

        
    </div>

</div>
