        <div class="columns"><div class="cmp-columns">
  <div class="column-1 container responsivegrid cmp-container--padding-top-medium X-Large cmp-container--padding-right-xlarge cmp-container--padding-top-small-mobile cmp-container--padding-left-medium-mobile cmp-container--padding-right-medium-mobile">

    
    
    
    <div id="container-8396c9327f" class="cmp-container">
        
        
        <div class="title title__gradient-skyBlueWhite title__fontWeight-light title__white title__paddingBottom-large">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;title-f7faf14fbe&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;core/wcm/components/title/v3/title&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-03-03T23:16:38Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;A New Standard of Resilience&#34;}}" id="title-f7faf14fbe" class="cmp-title">
    <h2 class="cmp-title__text">A New Standard of Resilience</h2>
</div>

    

</div>
<div class="text text__white text__paddingBottom-large">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-7bd287db24&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;druvaincprogram/components/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-03-03T23:22:28Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p style=\&#34;margin: 0.0px;\&#34;>Druva delivers cyber resilience through a fully managed SaaS platform with no hardware to maintain, no patches to apply, and no complexity to manage. Our cloud-native architecture scales across any cloud, while Druva’s agentic AI capabilities work behind the scenes to handle routine security tasks, initiate recovery, and simplify critical workflows.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p style=\&#34;margin: 0.0px;\&#34;>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p style=\&#34;margin: 0.0px;\&#34;>Trusted by thousands of global enterprises, Druva keeps organizations resilient around the clock.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-7bd287db24" class="cmp-text">
    <p style="	margin: 0.0px;
">Druva delivers cyber resilience through a fully managed SaaS platform with no hardware to maintain, no patches to apply, and no complexity to manage. Our cloud-native architecture scales across any cloud, while Druva’s agentic AI capabilities work behind the scenes to handle routine security tasks, initiate recovery, and simplify critical workflows.</p>
<p style="	margin: 0.0px;
"> </p>
<p style="	margin: 0.0px;
">Trusted by thousands of global enterprises, Druva keeps organizations resilient around the clock.</p>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="button">




  <a id="button-307a8947af" class="cmp-button    " data-cmp-clickable data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;button-307a8947af&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;core/wcm/components/button/v2/button&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-03-13T22:03:16Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Platform Overview&#34;,&#34;xdm:linkURL&#34;:&#34;/products/resilience-cloud/platform-overview&#34;}}" href="/products/resilience-cloud/platform-overview">
    <span class="cmp-button__text">Platform Overview</span>
    
  </a>



    

</div>

        
