<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;title-be8519b0e9&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;core/wcm/components/title/v3/title&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-03-09T20:20:06Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;What our customers say about us&#34;}}" id="title-be8519b0e9" class="cmp-title">
    <h2 class="cmp-title__text">What our customers say about us</h2>
</div>

    

</div>

        
    </div>

</div>
<div class="stacked-carousel aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

<div class="cmp-stacked-carousel" data-cmp-is="stacked-carousel">
    
    <button class="cmp-stacked-carousel__nav cmp-stacked-carousel__nav--prev" aria-label="Previous Slide">
        <span class="cmp-stacked-carousel__arrow-icon arrow-icon-left"></span>
    </button>

    <div class="cmp-stacked-carousel__stage">
        
            <div class="cmp-stacked-carousel__item">
                <div class="cmp-stacked-carousel__card">
                    
                    <div class="cmp-stacked-carousel__quote">
                        <p>After the incident, I knew our data was safe because we have Druva. Thanks to Druva, we were back to normal operations in no time.</p>

                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="cmp-stacked-carousel__footer">
                        <div class="cmp-stacked-carousel__author">
                            <span class="cmp-stacked-carousel__name">Rob Verbanac</span>
                            <span class="cmp-stacked-carousel__title">Senior Associate and Director of IT</span>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="cmp-stacked-carousel__logo">
                            <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/logos/spectorgroup-cs-logo.png" alt="Rob Verbanac Logo"/>
                        </div>
                    </div> 

                </div> 
            </div>
        
            <div class="cmp-stacked-carousel__item">
                <div class="cmp-stacked-carousel__card">
                    
                    <div class="cmp-stacked-carousel__quote">
                        <p>Druva simplifies data protection, making it effortless and efficient. With its clear, intuitive policy interface, setting up backups is super simple—and you can count on them to be reliable every time. Plus, the Druva AI assistant is a game-changer, giving you quick help and easy access to the info you need.</p>

                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="cmp-stacked-carousel__footer">
                        <div class="cmp-stacked-carousel__author">
                            <span class="cmp-stacked-carousel__name">Priya Choudhary</span>
                            <span class="cmp-stacked-carousel__title">Sr Endpoint Management Lead</span>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="cmp-stacked-carousel__logo">
                            <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/logos/zs-associates-logo.png" alt="Priya Choudhary Logo"/>
                        </div>
                    </div> 

                </div> 
            </div>
        
            <div class="cmp-stacked-carousel__item">
                <div class="cmp-stacked-carousel__card">
                    
                    <div class="cmp-stacked-carousel__quote">
                        <p>Druva has been instrumental in ensuring we never lose valuable data, especially in the fast-paced hospital setting. It gives me the confidence to assure my executives that our information is secure, and the ability to focus on our mission of saving lives.</p>

                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="cmp-stacked-carousel__footer">
                        <div class="cmp-stacked-carousel__author">
                            <span class="cmp-stacked-carousel__name">JT Mason</span>
                            <span class="cmp-stacked-carousel__title">VP of IT</span>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="cmp-stacked-carousel__logo">
                            <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/logos/donor-network-logo.png" alt="JT Mason Logo"/>
                        </div>
                    </div> 

                </div> 
            </div>
        
    </div>

    <button class="cmp-stacked-carousel__nav cmp-stacked-carousel__nav--next" aria-label="Next Slide">
        <span class="cmp-stacked-carousel__arrow-icon"></span>
    </button>

</div></div>
