        <div><div class="container responsivegrid cmp-container--padding-top-small">

    
    <div id="container-1603d0c462" class="cmp-container">
        
        


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="bio-list aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

<div class="cmp-bio-list" data-cmp-is="bio-list">
    <div class="cmp-bio-list__grid">
        
            <div class="cmp-bio-list__item">
                <div class="cmp-bio-list__card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="View Bio for Jaspreet Singh">                    
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__image">
                        <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/Jaspreet.png" alt="Jaspreet Singh" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__content">
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__name">Jaspreet Singh</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__role">Founder &amp; Chief Executive Officer</div>
                        
                        <span class="cmp-bio-list__arrow"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-bio-modal" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__overlay" data-action="close"></div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__container">
                        <button class="cmp-bio-modal__close" data-action="close" aria-label="Close Modal">
                            &times;
                        </button>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-modal__body">
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__image">
                                <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/Jaspreet.png" alt="Jaspreet Singh"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__details">
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__header">
                                    <h3 class="cmp-bio-modal__name">Jaspreet Singh</h3>
                                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__role">Founder &amp; Chief Executive Officer</div>
                                </div>                                
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__bio">
                                    <div class="cmp-leadership-bio__text__paragraph"><div id="container-6cb20f7f6f" class="cmp-container"><div class="text"><div id="text-796711eedf" class="cmp-text" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-796711eedf&#34;:{&#34;&#64;type&#34;:&#34;druvaincprogram/components/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2022-11-19T09:39:14Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p&gt;Founder and CEO, Jaspreet Singh, brings a combination of product vision and general manager experience and has led Druva to become one of the fastest-growing companies in the multi-billion dollar data protection and management industry. His entrepreneurial spirit enabled him to bootstrap Druva, which is now valued over $2 billion and trusted worldwide by thousands of companies at the forefront of embracing the cloud era. His market and technology insights led him to create the first cloud-native data protection platform, which delivers innovative technology solutions and a distinctive consumption model disrupting a legacy of aging hardware and software. Prior to starting Druva, Jaspreet held foundational roles at Veritas and Ensim Corp. Additionally, he holds multiple patents and has a B.S. in Computer Science from the Indian Institute of Technology, Guwahati.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&#34;}}"><p>Founder and CEO, Jaspreet Singh, brings a combination of product vision and general manager experience and has led Druva to become one of the fastest-growing companies in the multi-billion dollar data protection and management industry. His entrepreneurial spirit enabled him to bootstrap Druva, which is now valued over $2 billion and trusted worldwide by thousands of companies at the forefront of embracing the cloud era. His market and technology insights led him to create the first cloud-native data protection platform, which delivers innovative technology solutions and a distinctive consumption model disrupting a legacy of aging hardware and software. Prior to starting Druva, Jaspreet held foundational roles at Veritas and Ensim Corp. Additionally, he holds multiple patents and has a B.S. in Computer Science from the Indian Institute of Technology, Guwahati.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

                                </div>                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="cmp-bio-list__item">
                <div class="cmp-bio-list__card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="View Bio for Milind Borate">                    
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__image">
                        <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/Milind.png" alt="Milind Borate" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__content">
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__name">Milind Borate</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__role">Co-Founder &amp; Chief Development Officer</div>
                        
                        <span class="cmp-bio-list__arrow"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-bio-modal" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__overlay" data-action="close"></div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__container">
                        <button class="cmp-bio-modal__close" data-action="close" aria-label="Close Modal">
                            &times;
                        </button>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-modal__body">
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__image">
                                <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/Milind.png" alt="Milind Borate"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__details">
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__header">
                                    <h3 class="cmp-bio-modal__name">Milind Borate</h3>
                                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__role">Co-Founder &amp; Chief Development Officer</div>
                                </div>                                
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__bio">
                                    <div class="cmp-leadership-bio__text__paragraph"><div id="container-6cb20f7f6f" class="cmp-container"><div class="text"><div id="text-adbab39347" class="cmp-text" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-adbab39347&#34;:{&#34;&#64;type&#34;:&#34;druvaincprogram/components/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2022-11-19T10:05:39Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p&gt;Milind has more than 20 years’ experience in enterprise product development and delivery. Prior to co-founding Druva, he worked at Veritas Software as Technical Director for SAN-FS and served on the board of the Veritas patent committee. Milind holds several patents in storage technology and co-authored the book “Undocumented Windows NT” in 1998. His current areas of interest are cloud storage and machine learning for unstructured data. Milind is passionate about building engineering teams that deliver end-to-end solutions and among his favorite pass-times is philosophizing on software development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&#34;}}"><p>Milind has more than 20 years’ experience in enterprise product development and delivery. Prior to co-founding Druva, he worked at Veritas Software as Technical Director for SAN-FS and served on the board of the Veritas patent committee. Milind holds several patents in storage technology and co-authored the book “Undocumented Windows NT” in 1998. His current areas of interest are cloud storage and machine learning for unstructured data. Milind is passionate about building engineering teams that deliver end-to-end solutions and among his favorite pass-times is philosophizing on software development.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

                                </div>                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="cmp-bio-list__item">
                <div class="cmp-bio-list__card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="View Bio for Anthony Anzevino">                    
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__image">
                        <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/anthony-anzevino-bio.png" alt="Anthony Anzevino" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__content">
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__name">Anthony Anzevino</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__role">Chief Commercial and Partner Officer</div>
                        
                        <span class="cmp-bio-list__arrow"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-bio-modal" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__overlay" data-action="close"></div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__container">
                        <button class="cmp-bio-modal__close" data-action="close" aria-label="Close Modal">
                            &times;
                        </button>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-modal__body">
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__image">
                                <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/anthony-anzevino-bio.png" alt="Anthony Anzevino"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__details">
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__header">
                                    <h3 class="cmp-bio-modal__name">Anthony Anzevino</h3>
                                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__role">Chief Commercial and Partner Officer</div>
                                </div>                                
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__bio">
                                    <p>Anthony Anzevino is Chief Commercial and Partner Officer at Druva, where he leads the company’s global sales, commercial strategy, and routes to market. With more than 20 years of experience building and scaling global go-to-market organizations, he brings a customer-first approach centered on developing high-performing teams and strong partner relationships that drive sustainable growth.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Druva, Anzevino served as Chief Revenue Officer at Kaseya, leading its global go-to-market organization. At Commvault, he was instrumental in building the customer success organization for its SaaS business. He also led Veeam Software’s US Commercial and Canada division and held senior leadership roles at AWS, VMware, and Dell EMC.</p>

                                </div>                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="cmp-bio-list__item">
                <div class="cmp-bio-list__card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="View Bio for Ranga Rajagopalan">                    
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__image">
                        <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/Ranga.png" alt="Ranga Rajagopalan" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__content">
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__name">Ranga Rajagopalan</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__role">Chief Products &amp; Marketing Officer</div>
                        
                        <span class="cmp-bio-list__arrow"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-bio-modal" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__overlay" data-action="close"></div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__container">
                        <button class="cmp-bio-modal__close" data-action="close" aria-label="Close Modal">
                            &times;
                        </button>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-modal__body">
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__image">
                                <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/Ranga.png" alt="Ranga Rajagopalan"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__details">
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__header">
                                    <h3 class="cmp-bio-modal__name">Ranga Rajagopalan</h3>
                                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__role">Chief Products &amp; Marketing Officer</div>
                                </div>                                
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__bio">
                                    <p>Ranga has more than two decades of leadership experience in storage and data protection. As Chief Products and Marketing Officer, he is responsible for developing and executing the company’s overall marketing strategy to grow corporate share of voice, nurture customer and partner advocacy, and drive increased demand. He joins Druva from Commvault, where he was Sr. Vice President of Products and led the company’s product management and user experience efforts across its solution portfolio. Prior to this, Ranga held various engineering and product management leadership roles at Veritas, Dell EMC, and Violin Memory.</p>

                                </div>                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="cmp-bio-list__item">
                <div class="cmp-bio-list__card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="View Bio for Jagroop Bal">                    
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__image">
                        <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/jagroop.png" alt="Jagroop Bal" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__content">
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__name">Jagroop Bal</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__role">Chief Financial Officer</div>
                        
                        <span class="cmp-bio-list__arrow"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-bio-modal" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__overlay" data-action="close"></div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__container">
                        <button class="cmp-bio-modal__close" data-action="close" aria-label="Close Modal">
                            &times;
                        </button>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-modal__body">
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__image">
                                <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/jagroop.png" alt="Jagroop Bal"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__details">
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__header">
                                    <h3 class="cmp-bio-modal__name">Jagroop Bal</h3>
                                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__role">Chief Financial Officer</div>
                                </div>                                
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__bio">
                                    <p>Jagroop Bal is an accomplished financial leader with over two decades of experience driving financial strategy and business growth for global enterprise organizations. As Chief Financial Officer at Druva, he oversees Finance, Accounting, Legal, Tax, Treasury, and IT functions, ensuring strategic financial execution that accelerates the strategy and creates value for all stakeholders. </p>
<p>Before joining Druva, Bal served as Vice President of Finance and Investor Relations at VMware. In his tenure with VMware, Bal helped scale the company and transform the business model to subscription &amp; SaaS. He played a pivotal role in driving transformative M&amp;A, capital market transactions, and successful spinout from Dell Technologies. Prior to VMware, Bal held finance and corporate strategy roles at Hewlett Packard Enterprise, and was a management consultant at Deloitte and Accenture. He holds a BBA and MBA from The University of Michigan - Ross School of Business.</p>

                                </div>                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="cmp-bio-list__item">
                <div class="cmp-bio-list__card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="View Bio for Keith Lutz">                    
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__image">
                        <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/keith.png" alt="Keith Lutz" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__content">
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__name">Keith Lutz</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__role">Chief Information Officer</div>
                        
                        <span class="cmp-bio-list__arrow"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-bio-modal" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__overlay" data-action="close"></div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__container">
                        <button class="cmp-bio-modal__close" data-action="close" aria-label="Close Modal">
                            &times;
                        </button>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-modal__body">
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__image">
                                <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/keith.png" alt="Keith Lutz"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__details">
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__header">
                                    <h3 class="cmp-bio-modal__name">Keith Lutz</h3>
                                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__role">Chief Information Officer</div>
                                </div>                                
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__bio">
                                    <p>Keith is a technology and business leader with more than 25 years of experience driving digital transformation and aligning IT strategy with organizational goals. As Chief Information Officer at Druva, he leads the vision and execution of enterprise systems strategy, while championing modernization efforts across core business platforms. His focus is on delivering scalable, automated, and integrated technology solutions that support innovation and long-term growth.</p>
<p>Before joining Druva, Keith served as Sr. Vice President and CIO at Ivanti, where he spearheaded major digital transformation initiatives. His leadership was instrumental in scaling the company&#39;s revenue from $495M to over $1.2B through the modernization of legacy infrastructure, implementation of a cloud-first strategy, and creation of a formal change management function to drive user adoption and business value. Earlier in his career, Keith held senior IT leadership and engineering roles at Mattress Firm, Specific Media, and Myspace, building a strong foundation in technology operations and strategic execution.</p>

                                </div>                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="cmp-bio-list__item">
                <div class="cmp-bio-list__card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="View Bio for Genil Washington">                    
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__image">
                        <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/genil-washington.png" alt="Genil Washington" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__content">
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__name">Genil Washington</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__role">Senior Vice President, People &amp; Culture</div>
                        
                        <span class="cmp-bio-list__arrow"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-bio-modal" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__overlay" data-action="close"></div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__container">
                        <button class="cmp-bio-modal__close" data-action="close" aria-label="Close Modal">
                            &times;
                        </button>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-modal__body">
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__image">
                                <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/genil-washington.png" alt="Genil Washington"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__details">
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__header">
                                    <h3 class="cmp-bio-modal__name">Genil Washington</h3>
                                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__role">Senior Vice President, People &amp; Culture</div>
                                </div>                                
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__bio">
                                    <p>Genil Washington serves as Senior Vice President, People and Culture at Druva, where she leads the company&#39;s global human resources function, encompassing talent strategy, organizational development, and workplace culture. She brings more than 20 years of progressive HR leadership experience across the healthcare, telecommunications, and technology sectors.</p><p>Prior to joining Druva as Vice President of Global Talent Acquisition — and subsequently being elevated to Senior Vice President, People and Culture — Genil held senior HR roles at both public and private companies, where she developed deep expertise in talent strategy, performance management, culture, workforce planning, and organizational design. Most recently, she served as head of Global Talent Operations at Coupa Software, where she played an instrumental role in expanding the company&#39;s distributed workforce strategy and leading the people function through its transition from public to private.</p><p>Genil is an Adjunct Professor of Human Resources at Golden Gate University, where she also earned her Master of Science in Human Resource Management. She is an executive member of Transform and serves as a Board Advisor for Talent Collective. She previously served on the boards of Women in Cable Telecommunications and the National Association of Healthcare Executives.</p>
                                </div>                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="cmp-bio-list__item">
                <div class="cmp-bio-list__card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="View Bio for Yogesh Badwe">                    
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__image">
                        <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/yogesh.png" alt="Yogesh Badwe" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__content">
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__name">Yogesh Badwe</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__role">Chief Security Officer</div>
                        
                        <span class="cmp-bio-list__arrow"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-bio-modal" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__overlay" data-action="close"></div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__container">
                        <button class="cmp-bio-modal__close" data-action="close" aria-label="Close Modal">
                            &times;
                        </button>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-modal__body">
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__image">
                                <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/yogesh.png" alt="Yogesh Badwe"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__details">
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__header">
                                    <h3 class="cmp-bio-modal__name">Yogesh Badwe</h3>
                                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__role">Chief Security Officer</div>
                                </div>                                
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__bio">
                                    <p>As Druva’s CSO, Yogesh is responsible for overseeing all facets of Druva’s cybersecurity program and driving initiatives to help the company and its customers achieve cyber and data resilience. He is passionate about helping organizations secure their digital transformation journeys to the cloud.  </p>
<p>Yogesh brings 15 years of strong cybersecurity leadership experience to Druva, having held senior positions at high-growth organizations such as Okta, Salesforce, Orange Business Services and Global Telesystems Ltd. Most recently, Yogesh served as Senior Director of Information Security at Okta where he was instrumental in helping build and lead the security function through a period of significant business growth from $40M to $1.2B in ARR, and securing the company’s journey through a successful IPO in 2017.</p>

                                </div>                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="cmp-bio-list__item">
                <div class="cmp-bio-list__card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="View Bio for Hsinya Shen">                    
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__image">
                        <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/Hsinya.png" alt="Hsinya Shen" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__content">
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__name">Hsinya Shen</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__role">General Counsel</div>
                        
                        <span class="cmp-bio-list__arrow"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-bio-modal" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__overlay" data-action="close"></div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__container">
                        <button class="cmp-bio-modal__close" data-action="close" aria-label="Close Modal">
                            &times;
                        </button>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-modal__body">
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__image">
                                <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/Hsinya.png" alt="Hsinya Shen"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__details">
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__header">
                                    <h3 class="cmp-bio-modal__name">Hsinya Shen</h3>
                                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__role">General Counsel</div>
                                </div>                                
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__bio">
                                    <p>Hsinya brings 25 years of legal expertise in the technology industry to Druva. She has represented public and private companies of all sizes, specializing in the SaaS industry. She joins Druva from Productiv, Inc., where she served as VP of Legal, covering all legal matters. Hsinya was trained at Orrick, Herrington &amp; Sutcliffe LLP and started her in-house career at Yahoo! Inc. Outside of the technology industry, Hsinya serves on the board of a community bank and as a member of the Palo Alto Public Art Commission. Hsinya obtained her BA from Wellesley and her law degree from Georgetown.</p>

                                </div>                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="cmp-bio-list__item">
                <div class="cmp-bio-list__card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="View Bio for Madhup Nagpal">                    
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__image">
                        <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/madhup.png" alt="Madhup Nagpal" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__content">
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__name">Madhup Nagpal</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__role">Senior Vice President, Global Customer Success</div>
                        
                        <span class="cmp-bio-list__arrow"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-bio-modal" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__overlay" data-action="close"></div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__container">
                        <button class="cmp-bio-modal__close" data-action="close" aria-label="Close Modal">
                            &times;
                        </button>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-modal__body">
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__image">
                                <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/madhup.png" alt="Madhup Nagpal"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__details">
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__header">
                                    <h3 class="cmp-bio-modal__name">Madhup Nagpal</h3>
                                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__role">Senior Vice President, Global Customer Success</div>
                                </div>                                
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__bio">
                                    <p>Madhup brings over 14 years of leadership experience in Global Customer Services and Support, Business Operations, and Service Delivery. As Senior Vice President of Global Customer Success at Druva, he is responsible for ensuring exceptional customer satisfaction, driving operational excellence, and scaling Druva&#39;s services to meet the demands of a growing global customer base. Madhup joined Druva in 2017, serving as Senior Director of Product Support and later as Vice President before stepping into his current role. Prior to Druva, he held leadership positions at Hewlett Packard Enterprise, where he managed multiple service delivery teams and critical accounts as Service Delivery Leader, and Avaya, where he advanced from Senior Software Engineer to Service Delivery Lead over nearly a decade. With a proven track record of building high-performing teams and delivering flawless execution, Madhup is dedicated to empowering customers and driving Druva&#39;s success in the data protection landscape.</p>

                                </div>                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
    </div>
</div>

    
</div>

    
</div>

    </div>

    
</div>
</div>

        

