<div id="tabs-42384e09a9-item-42b57855a1-tabpanel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tabs-42384e09a9-item-42b57855a1-tab" tabindex="0" class="cmp-tabs__tabpanel " data-cmp-hook-tabs="tabpanel">

        <div><div class="container responsivegrid cmp-container--padding-top-small">

    
    <div id="container-42b57855a1" class="cmp-container">
        
        


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="bio-list aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

<div class="cmp-bio-list" data-cmp-is="bio-list">
    <div class="cmp-bio-list__grid">
        
            <div class="cmp-bio-list__item">
                <div class="cmp-bio-list__card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="View Bio for Mike Gustafson">                    
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__image">
                        <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/mikegustafson.png" alt="Mike Gustafson" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__content">
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__name">Mike Gustafson</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__role">Chairman of the Board</div>
                        
                        <span class="cmp-bio-list__arrow"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-bio-modal" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__overlay" data-action="close"></div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__container">
                        <button class="cmp-bio-modal__close" data-action="close" aria-label="Close Modal">
                            &times;
                        </button>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-modal__body">
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__image">
                                <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/mikegustafson.png" alt="Mike Gustafson"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__details">
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__header">
                                    <h3 class="cmp-bio-modal__name">Mike Gustafson</h3>
                                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__role">Chairman of the Board</div>
                                </div>                                
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__bio">
                                    <p>Mike Gustafson has been Chairman and an Independent Board Director at Druva since April 2016. In his more than 25 years of experience, he has successfully led multiple technology companies and teams including public and private companies across infrastructure and software offerings, as well as high growth businesses from pre-revenue to multi-billion dollar revenues. Mike was previously CEO and Chairman of Virident Systems, which was acquired by Western Digital Corporation, and where he became SVP and GM of the Flash Systems Business Unit. He also served as CEO and Board Member of BlueArc Corporation, which was acquired by Hitachi Data Systems, where he later served as Senior Vice President and General Manager of the File and Content Business. Earlier in his career, Mike was SVP of Sales, Services, and Marketing at McDATA (MCDT), which went public in 2000. He has also held executive positions across sales, products, and channels at IBM.</p>
<p>Mike also serves on the boards of Reltio, Matterport, Everspin (MRAM), Pavilion Data Systems, and PDF Solutions (PDFS), and is a Member of the Board of Trustees of the MS Society. He is a graduate of Washington University in St. Louis – John M. Olin School of Business.</p>

                                </div>                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="cmp-bio-list__item">
                <div class="cmp-bio-list__card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="View Bio for Tracey Newell">                    
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__image">
                        <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/traceynewell.png" alt="Tracey Newell" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__content">
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__name">Tracey Newell</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__role">Board Member</div>
                        
                        <span class="cmp-bio-list__arrow"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-bio-modal" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__overlay" data-action="close"></div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__container">
                        <button class="cmp-bio-modal__close" data-action="close" aria-label="Close Modal">
                            &times;
                        </button>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-modal__body">
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__image">
                                <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/traceynewell.png" alt="Tracey Newell"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__details">
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__header">
                                    <h3 class="cmp-bio-modal__name">Tracey Newell</h3>
                                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__role">Board Member</div>
                                </div>                                
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__bio">
                                    <p>Tracey Newell is the former president of Informatica, where she also served as a member of the company’s board of directors for two years prior to being asked to join the management team. Prior to joining Informatica, Newell served as executive vice president of global field operations at Proofpoint, where she led sales through a five-year period of hypergrowth. Recognized as a Top 100 Sales Leader by The Modern Sale, Newell led Proofpoint’s go-to-market team to become a top five leader in the cybersecurity market. Newell has also served as executive vice president of global sales at Polycom and held sales leadership positions at Juniper Networks, Webex, and Cisco Systems.</p>
<p>Newell currently serves in the non-profit organization Impact 100, and is also a member of the board of advisors for the University of California, Santa Barbara’s economics department. In addition to Druva, Newell serves on the board of directors of DataRobot, Highspot, Sailpoint, and Sumo Logic. </p>

                                </div>                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="cmp-bio-list__item">
                <div class="cmp-bio-list__card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="View Bio for Shailendra Singh">                    
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__image">
                        <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/shailendra%20singh.png" alt="Shailendra Singh" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__content">
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__name">Shailendra Singh</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__role">Managing Director</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__company">Sequoia Capital</div>
                        <span class="cmp-bio-list__arrow"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-bio-modal" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__overlay" data-action="close"></div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__container">
                        <button class="cmp-bio-modal__close" data-action="close" aria-label="Close Modal">
                            &times;
                        </button>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-modal__body">
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__image">
                                <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/shailendra%20singh.png" alt="Shailendra Singh"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__details">
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__header">
                                    <h3 class="cmp-bio-modal__name">Shailendra Singh</h3>
                                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__role">Managing Director</div>
                                </div>                                
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__bio">
                                    <p>Shailendra is a Managing Director at Sequoia Capital India and is based out of Bangalore. He has been at the firm for over ten years, and led over a dozen investments in India and SE Asia. He focuses on Consumer Internet/Mobile and Enterprise Software investments, from seed stage to early growth capital. His current board seats include Carousell, Craftsvilla, Druva, Go-Jek, JustDial (NSE:JUSTDIAL), Mu Sigma, Pine Labs, Practo, Scio Health Analytics, Tokopedia and Voonik. His prior investments include Freecharge (acquired by Snapdeal), GlobalLogic (acquired by Apax Partners), Infoedge (NSE:NAUKRI) and eClerx (NSE:ECLERX). Prior to Sequoia, Shailendra worked at Bain &amp; Co in New York and was earlier an entrepreneur in Silicon Valley during the dotcom bubble. Shailendra received an MBA with distinction from Harvard Business School and a Chemical Engineering degree from IIT Mumbai. Shailendra is also a Kauffman Fellow.</p>

                                </div>                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="cmp-bio-list__item">
                <div class="cmp-bio-list__card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="View Bio for Bill Losch">                    
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__image">
                        <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/BillLosch.png" alt="Bill Losch" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__content">
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__name">Bill Losch</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__role">Former Chief Financial Officer</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__company">Okta</div>
                        <span class="cmp-bio-list__arrow"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-bio-modal" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__overlay" data-action="close"></div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__container">
                        <button class="cmp-bio-modal__close" data-action="close" aria-label="Close Modal">
                            &times;
                        </button>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-modal__body">
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__image">
                                <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/BillLosch.png" alt="Bill Losch"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__details">
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__header">
                                    <h3 class="cmp-bio-modal__name">Bill Losch</h3>
                                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__role">Former Chief Financial Officer</div>
                                </div>                                
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__bio">
                                    <p>Bill Losch served as chief financial officer of Okta, Inc., an identity management platform for enterprises, from June 2013 to March 2021. From June 2007 to June 2013, he served as chief financial officer at MobiTV, Inc., a technology platform provider of multiscreen video delivery services. From October 2004 to May 2007, Mr. Losch served as chief accounting officer of DreamWorks Animation, SKG, Inc., an animation company. From March 1998 to July 2003, Mr. Losch served in various finance positions, most recently as vice president of finance and chief accounting officer at Yahoo! Inc., an Internet company. Mr. Losch also serves on the board of Pagerduty (PD) and Onfido. He holds a bachelor of arts in economics from the University of California, Los Angeles.</p>

                                </div>                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="cmp-bio-list__item">
                <div class="cmp-bio-list__card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="View Bio for Jishnu Bhattacharjee">                    
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__image">
                        <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/jishnub.png" alt="Jishnu Bhattacharjee" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__content">
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__name">Jishnu Bhattacharjee</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__role">Managing Director</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__company">Nexus Venture Partners</div>
                        <span class="cmp-bio-list__arrow"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-bio-modal" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__overlay" data-action="close"></div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__container">
                        <button class="cmp-bio-modal__close" data-action="close" aria-label="Close Modal">
                            &times;
                        </button>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-modal__body">
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__image">
                                <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/jishnub.png" alt="Jishnu Bhattacharjee"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__details">
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__header">
                                    <h3 class="cmp-bio-modal__name">Jishnu Bhattacharjee</h3>
                                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__role">Managing Director</div>
                                </div>                                
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__bio">
                                    <p>Jishnu Bhattacharjee is Managing Director at Nexus Venture Partners, a leading US – India venture capital firm, investing in innovative early to early-growth stage companies. Jishnu has invested in technology infrastructure, data, AI, SaaS and developer operations and is interested in a wide variety of start-ups. Jishnu’s current board involvements include Postman, Druva, H20.ai, Observe.ai, Jiffy.ai, Helpshift, Minio, Blueshift, Kaltura and other exciting companies. His exited investments include Rancher (acquired by SUSE), Mezi (acquired by American Express), Cloud.com (acquired by Citrix), Gluster (acquired by Red Hat), Arkin (acquired by VMware) and Elastic Box (acquired by Century Link).</p>
<p>Jishnu holds MBA from the Stanford Graduate School of Business, MS from Georgia Tech and BTech from IIT Kharagpur in electronics engineering. He is also an inventor on more than twenty US patents.</p>

                                </div>                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="cmp-bio-list__item">
                <div class="cmp-bio-list__card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="View Bio for Dovaldas Buzinskas">                    
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__image">
                        <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/dovaldasb.png" alt="Dovaldas Buzinskas" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__content">
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__name">Dovaldas Buzinskas</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__role">Director, Private Equity</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__company">CDPQ Singapore</div>
                        <span class="cmp-bio-list__arrow"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-bio-modal" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__overlay" data-action="close"></div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__container">
                        <button class="cmp-bio-modal__close" data-action="close" aria-label="Close Modal">
                            &times;
                        </button>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-modal__body">
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__image">
                                <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/dovaldasb.png" alt="Dovaldas Buzinskas"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__details">
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__header">
                                    <h3 class="cmp-bio-modal__name">Dovaldas Buzinskas</h3>
                                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__role">Director, Private Equity</div>
                                </div>                                
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__bio">
                                    <p>Dovaldas is Director, Private Equity at CDPQ, a global investment group with CAD 365.5 billion assets under management. Based in Singapore, he covers direct investments in Asia-Pacific with a strong focus on the technology and health care segments.</p>
<p>Dovaldas joined CDPQ in 2017 and has over 10 years of experience in Private Equity and M&amp;A.</p>
<p>Previously, Dovaldas worked at Antin Infrastructure Partners, a leading Private Equity firm focusing on infrastructure investments with over €15 billion assets under management. He started his career at Goldman Sachs in Paris, in the Investment Banking division covering France and Benelux.</p>
<p>Dovaldas holds a Master in Finance from HEC Paris and currently sits on the Boards of Directors of Druva, PharmEasy and Healthscope.</p>

                                </div>                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="cmp-bio-list__item">
                <div class="cmp-bio-list__card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="View Bio for Harish Belur">                    
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__image">
                        <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/bod-harishbelur.png" alt="Harish Belur" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__content">
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__name">Harish Belur</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__role">Vice President</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__company">Riverwood Capital</div>
                        <span class="cmp-bio-list__arrow"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-bio-modal" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__overlay" data-action="close"></div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__container">
                        <button class="cmp-bio-modal__close" data-action="close" aria-label="Close Modal">
                            &times;
                        </button>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-modal__body">
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__image">
                                <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/bod-harishbelur.png" alt="Harish Belur"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__details">
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__header">
                                    <h3 class="cmp-bio-modal__name">Harish Belur</h3>
                                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__role">Vice President</div>
                                </div>                                
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__bio">
                                    <p>Harish Belur joined Riverwood Capital in 2011 as Vice President. Prior to Riverwood, Harish worked at Cisco Systems where he led Product Management teams in Switching, Routing and Smart Grid sectors. Previously, Harish co-founded and led Product Management at Greenfield Networks, which was acquired by Cisco Systems and resulted in industry leading ME-3×00 carrier ethernet access products. Harish has a BTech in EE from the Indian Institute of Technology, Delhi and an MBA from The Wharton School at the University of Pennsylvania.</p>

                                </div>                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="cmp-bio-list__item">
                <div class="cmp-bio-list__card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="View Bio for Jaspreet Singh">                    
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__image">
                        <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/Jaspreet.png" alt="Jaspreet Singh" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__content">
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__name">Jaspreet Singh</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__role">Founder &amp; Chief Executive Officer</div>
                        
                        <span class="cmp-bio-list__arrow"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-bio-modal" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__overlay" data-action="close"></div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__container">
                        <button class="cmp-bio-modal__close" data-action="close" aria-label="Close Modal">
                            &times;
                        </button>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-modal__body">
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__image">
                                <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/Jaspreet.png" alt="Jaspreet Singh"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__details">
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__header">
                                    <h3 class="cmp-bio-modal__name">Jaspreet Singh</h3>
                                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__role">Founder &amp; Chief Executive Officer</div>
                                </div>                                
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__bio">
                                    <div class="cmp-leadership-bio__text__paragraph"><div id="container-6cb20f7f6f" class="cmp-container"><div class="text"><div id="text-796711eedf" class="cmp-text" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-796711eedf&#34;:{&#34;&#64;type&#34;:&#34;druvaincprogram/components/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2022-11-19T09:39:14Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p&gt;Founder and CEO, Jaspreet Singh, brings a combination of product vision and general manager experience and has led Druva to become one of the fastest-growing companies in the multi-billion dollar data protection and management industry. His entrepreneurial spirit enabled him to bootstrap Druva, which is now valued over $2 billion and trusted worldwide by thousands of companies at the forefront of embracing the cloud era. His market and technology insights led him to create the first cloud-native data protection platform, which delivers innovative technology solutions and a distinctive consumption model disrupting a legacy of aging hardware and software. Prior to starting Druva, Jaspreet held foundational roles at Veritas and Ensim Corp. Additionally, he holds multiple patents and has a B.S. in Computer Science from the Indian Institute of Technology, Guwahati.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&#34;}}"><p>Founder and CEO, Jaspreet Singh, brings a combination of product vision and general manager experience and has led Druva to become one of the fastest-growing companies in the multi-billion dollar data protection and management industry. His entrepreneurial spirit enabled him to bootstrap Druva, which is now valued over $2 billion and trusted worldwide by thousands of companies at the forefront of embracing the cloud era. His market and technology insights led him to create the first cloud-native data protection platform, which delivers innovative technology solutions and a distinctive consumption model disrupting a legacy of aging hardware and software. Prior to starting Druva, Jaspreet held foundational roles at Veritas and Ensim Corp. Additionally, he holds multiple patents and has a B.S. in Computer Science from the Indian Institute of Technology, Guwahati.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

                                </div>                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="cmp-bio-list__item">
                <div class="cmp-bio-list__card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="View Bio for Milind Borate">                    
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__image">
                        <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/Milind.png" alt="Milind Borate" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__content">
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__name">Milind Borate</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__role">Co-Founder &amp; Chief Development Officer</div>
                        
                        <span class="cmp-bio-list__arrow"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-bio-modal" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__overlay" data-action="close"></div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__container">
                        <button class="cmp-bio-modal__close" data-action="close" aria-label="Close Modal">
                            &times;
                        </button>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-modal__body">
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__image">
                                <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/Milind.png" alt="Milind Borate"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__details">
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__header">
                                    <h3 class="cmp-bio-modal__name">Milind Borate</h3>
                                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__role">Co-Founder &amp; Chief Development Officer</div>
                                </div>                                
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__bio">
                                    <div class="cmp-leadership-bio__text__paragraph"><div id="container-6cb20f7f6f" class="cmp-container"><div class="text"><div id="text-adbab39347" class="cmp-text" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-adbab39347&#34;:{&#34;&#64;type&#34;:&#34;druvaincprogram/components/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2022-11-19T10:05:39Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p&gt;Milind has more than 20 years’ experience in enterprise product development and delivery. Prior to co-founding Druva, he worked at Veritas Software as Technical Director for SAN-FS and served on the board of the Veritas patent committee. Milind holds several patents in storage technology and co-authored the book “Undocumented Windows NT” in 1998. His current areas of interest are cloud storage and machine learning for unstructured data. Milind is passionate about building engineering teams that deliver end-to-end solutions and among his favorite pass-times is philosophizing on software development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&#34;}}"><p>Milind has more than 20 years’ experience in enterprise product development and delivery. Prior to co-founding Druva, he worked at Veritas Software as Technical Director for SAN-FS and served on the board of the Veritas patent committee. Milind holds several patents in storage technology and co-authored the book “Undocumented Windows NT” in 1998. His current areas of interest are cloud storage and machine learning for unstructured data. Milind is passionate about building engineering teams that deliver end-to-end solutions and among his favorite pass-times is philosophizing on software development.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

                                </div>                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="cmp-bio-list__item">
                <div class="cmp-bio-list__card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="View Bio for Tom Banahan">                    
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__image">
                        <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/bod-tombanahan.png" alt="Tom Banahan" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-list__content">
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__name">Tom Banahan</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__role">Managing Director</div>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-list__company">Tenaya Capital</div>
                        <span class="cmp-bio-list__arrow"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-bio-modal" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__overlay" data-action="close"></div>
                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__container">
                        <button class="cmp-bio-modal__close" data-action="close" aria-label="Close Modal">
                            &times;
                        </button>
                        <div class="cmp-bio-modal__body">
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__image">
                                <img src="/content/dam/druvaincprogram/redesign/people/bod-tombanahan.png" alt="Tom Banahan"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-bio-modal__details">
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__header">
                                    <h3 class="cmp-bio-modal__name">Tom Banahan</h3>
                                    <div class="cmp-bio-modal__role">Managing Director</div>
                                </div>                                
                                <div class="cmp-bio-modal__bio">
                                    <p>Tom is a Managing Director with Tenaya Capital. Tom has been with Tenaya since 1999 and was included on the Forbes Midas List of Top Tech Investors for the past two years. Prior to joining Tenaya, Tom spent 20 years working in business development and sales in the technology industry. He was part of the executive teams that brought both Marimba and Spyglass to public offering, and began his career in the sales organization at IBM. Tom holds a B.A. from the University of California, Santa Barbara.</p>

                                </div>                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
    </div>
</div>

    
</div>

    
</div>

    </div>

    
</div>
</div>

        

    </div>

</div></div>

        
    </div>

</div>
